; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">운행노선 : 운행구간 및 운행시간표 참조(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">추후 노선이 변경될 수 있음</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 후 원 금</span></p><p><!--StartFragment--></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#99ccff\" height=\"63\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"78\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY동녘B'; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">구 분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.6pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.6pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"31\" valign=\"center\" width=\"239\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center